          "en": "we don't see that here in our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.64,
          "end": 33.603,
          "en": "And ultimately we wanna build an application users can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.62,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "So therefore the next goal is to output a list of goals,",
