          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.48,
          "end": 54.09,
          "en": "because this again will not be a route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.09,
          "end": 56.97,
          "en": "but instead a component we use in another component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.97,
          "end": 59.433,
          "en": "In this case, in another route component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.69,
          "end": 63.27,
          "en": "If you take a look at this NewNoteList component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.27,
          "end": 66.06,
          "en": "in this NewNoteList.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.06,
          "end": 69.3,
          "en": "you see that it expects to get a notes prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.3,
          "end": 71.7,
          "en": "And then I map through all my props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 74.7,
          "en": "to then simply output some data about my notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.7,
          "end": 78.24,
          "en": "For example, output the date, which is encoded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.24,
          "end": 82.53,
          "en": "in the ID of every note due to the logic we wrote here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.53,
          "end": 85.39,
          "en": "in this action, we're adding the date as an ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.61,
          "end": 89.55,
          "en": "and we're also outputting the title and the content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.55,
          "end": 90.9,
          "en": "That's what I'm doing here.",
