        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.9,
          "end": 94.10300000000001,
          "en": "I'm also importing some styles from NoteList CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.10300000000001,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "in this NoteList jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 98.64,
          "en": "And then I surface those links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.64,
          "end": 100.68299999999999,
          "en": "by exporting a links function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.91,
          "end": 105.24000000000001,
          "en": "Therefore, we can now go back to notes.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 108.57,
          "en": "and there import this NoteList component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.57,
          "end": 112.74000000000001,
          "en": "and import those surfaced links as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.74000000000001,
          "end": 117.74000000000001,
          "en": "So I import NoteList from Tilda components, NoteList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.00999999999999,
          "end": 122.55,
          "en": "and from that same file, I also import those links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.55,
          "end": 125.583,
          "en": "and I give it an alias of NoteList links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.75,
          "end": 130.17,
          "en": "By the way, now you also see why I'm using aliases here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.17,
          "end": 132.87,
          "en": "because the function which is exported",
