        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.87,
          "end": 136.02,
          "en": "by those component files is always called links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.02,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "and therefore we would've a name clash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 140.943,
          "en": "if we wouldn't assign aliases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.14,
          "end": 144.72,
          "en": "Now I just need to add those links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.72,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "exported by this component file to the links made available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.81,
          "end": 150.36,
          "en": "by this route, and therefore in the links function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.36,
          "end": 155.36,
          "en": "of this route I just also spread my NoteList links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.73,
          "end": 157.503,
          "en": "into this array like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.46,
          "end": 161.04,
          "en": "So now this route, when it's loaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.04,
          "end": 163.56,
          "en": "will load all the CSS files that are needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.56,
          "end": 166.713,
          "en": "for all the components that we use in this route component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 170.73,
          "en": "Speaking of that, I of course wanna use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.73,
          "end": 172.86,
          "en": "this NoteList component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.86,
          "end": 177,
          "en": "And here my idea simply is that I output my NoteList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177,
          "end": 179.673,
          "en": "below my NewNote like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.2,
          "end": 184.83,
          "en": "However, this NoteList component of course, as mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.83,
          "end": 188.22,
          "en": "needs a notes prop, it needs to get some notes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.22,
          "end": 190.71,
          "en": "that should be output and that's the part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.71,
          "end": 193.26,
          "en": "where we now need to fetch data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.26,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "We need to fetch that data from this notes.json file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "and that again means we'll write some backend code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 203.82,
          "en": "because reaching out to a data source like a database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.82,
          "end": 207.18,
          "en": "or in this case, this file is a backend task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 207.18,
          "end": 210.6,
          "en": "This file is also stored on the backend by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.6,
          "end": 212.88,
          "en": "It's not downloaded to our users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.88,
          "end": 214.923,
          "en": "it's on the backend on our server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.36,
          "end": 218.7,
          "en": "So therefore in the notes route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.7,
          "end": 220.62,
          "en": "we have to add more backend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.62,
          "end": 223.07999999999998,
          "en": "But this time it's not an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.07999999999998,
          "end": 226.07999999999998,
          "en": "because now I don't wanna act upon some forms submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 226.07999999999998,
          "end": 228.06,
          "en": "but instead I wanna load the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 228.06,
          "end": 230.04,
          "en": "whenever this component is loaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.04,
          "end": 232.773,
          "en": "whenever a get request reaches this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 234.03,
          "end": 237.06,
          "en": "And that's achieved by exporting another function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.06,
          "end": 239.643,
          "en": "the loader function like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 240.99,
          "end": 243.96,
          "en": "Loader like action is a reserve name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 243.96,
          "end": 246.99,
          "en": "just like links and Remix will be looking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.99,
          "end": 250.11,
          "en": "for such a function, hence we also must export it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 250.11,
          "end": 252.87,
          "en": "so that Remix can find it in this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 252.87,
          "end": 255.24,
          "en": "And loader will be triggered by Remix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.24,
          "end": 258.63,
          "en": "will be called by Remix whenever a get request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 258.63,
          "end": 260.61,
          "en": "reaches this route which basically means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.61,
          "end": 262.62,
          "en": "whenever we wanna view this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262.62,
          "end": 265.59,
          "en": "whenever this component is about to be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.59,
          "end": 268.05,
          "en": "And keep in mind the component will be pre-rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 268.05,
          "end": 269.25,
          "en": "on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.25,
          "end": 270.81,
          "en": "On the server, it will be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.81,
          "end": 274.59000000000003,
          "en": "and the finished HTML code is sent to the client then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 274.59000000000003,
          "end": 276.69,
          "en": "along with some JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.69,
          "end": 279.72,
          "en": "so that we still have an interactive website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 279.72,
          "end": 281.79,
          "en": "for the end user but it's prepared",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 281.79,
          "end": 284.19,
          "en": "and pre-rendered on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 284.19,
          "end": 287.34000000000003,
          "en": "Therefore, it's now in this loader where we now write",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 287.34000000000003,
          "end": 290.82,
          "en": "more backend code, because just like the code in the action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 290.82,
          "end": 294.12,
          "en": "code in the loader will be executed on the backend only,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 294.12,
          "end": 295.95,
          "en": "it will never reach the front end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 295.95,
          "end": 297.723,
          "en": "never reach the client side.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
